492","SecondaryAttribute":"\"Jerk boyfriend\" \u00a0Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person ha..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<u><strong><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">\"Jerk boyfriend\"<\/span><\/strong><\/u><br><br>&nbsp;Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br>\n<br>\nThis person used to be excellent boyfriend. In the past, this person never treated girlfriend poorly. Now, however, this person is a \"jerk boyfriend\" and never treats girlfriend with the proper amount of respect and affection.&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"\"Jerk boyfriend\" \u00a0Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person ha...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<u><strong><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">\"Jerk boyfriend\"<\/span><\/strong><\/u><br><br>&nbsp;Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br>\n<br>\nThis person used to be excellent boyfriend. In the past, this person never treated girlfriend poorly. Now, however, this person is a \"jerk boyfriend\" and never treats girlfriend with the proper amount of respect and affection.&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Q1492","QuestionID":"QID1492"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1334","SecondaryAttribute":"\"Jerk romantic partner\" \u00a0Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this pe..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<u><strong><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">&quot;Jerk romantic partner&quot;<\/span><\/strong><\/u><br \/>\n<br \/>\n&nbsp;Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">This person used to be an excellent romantic partner. In the past, this person never treated their partner poorly.<br \/>\n<u>Now, however, this person is a &quot;jerk romantic partner&quot; and never treats their partner with the proper amount of respect and affection<\/u>.&nbsp;<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"rp-neg-int","QuestionID":"QID1334","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"\"Jerk romantic partner\" \u00a0Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this pe...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"QC","PrimaryAttribute":"Survey Question Count","SecondaryAttribute":"1628","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":null},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1298","SecondaryAttribute":"= WARNING: Survey includes attention and comprehension checks. If you do not like participating i...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">= WARNING: Survey includes attention and comprehension checks. If you do not like participating in surveys with checks, please return the HIT now.=<\/span><\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Do you understand the study outline and are willing to participate in a survey with comprehension checks?<\/span><\/div>","DataExportTag":"outline2","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"= WARNING: Survey includes attention and comprehension checks. If you do not like participating i...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Yes<\/span>"},"2":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">No<\/span>"},"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Not sure, probably not<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","4"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"Type":"All","TotalRandSubset":""},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":5,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1298","RecodeValues":{"1":"1","2":"0","4":"99"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1443","SecondaryAttribute":"Abortion\u00a0 \u00a0 Someone used to vandalize abortion clinics. However, now this person thinks that othe.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Abortion&nbsp;<\/strong><\/u><\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Someone used to vandalize abortion clinics. However, now this person thinks that other people\u2019s choices should be respected and no longer vandalizes abortion clinics.<br>\n&nbsp;<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"abor-int","QuestionID":"QID1443","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Abortion\u00a0 \u00a0 Someone used to vandalize abortion clinics. However, now this person thinks that othe...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":3}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1374","SecondaryAttribute":"Against terrorism Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person ha...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong><u>Against terrorism<\/u><\/strong><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">This person lives in a culture that supports terrorism. In the past, this person supported the idea of terrorism to achieve political goals.<br \/>\n<u>Now, however, this person believes that terrorism is wrong<\/u>.<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ter-pos-int","QuestionID":"QID1374","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Against terrorism Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person ha...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1528","SecondaryAttribute":"Alcoholic Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a diff...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Alcoholic<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person used to be a teetotaler. In the past, this person never tried a drink of alcohol and never expressed any interest in drinking. Now, however, this person is an alcoholic.\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Alcoholic Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a diff...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":9,"NextAnswerId":4,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Alcoholic<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person used to be a teetotaler. In the past, this person never tried a drink of alcohol and never expressed any interest in drinking. Now, however, this person is an alcoholic.\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n<\/div>","DataExportTag":"Q1528","QuestionID":"QID1528"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1459","SecondaryAttribute":"Alcoholic quitting alcohol Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<u><strong><span style=\"font-size:22px;\">Alcoholic quitting alcohol<\/span><\/strong><\/u><br>\n<br>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">This person used to be an alcoholic. In the past, this person never tried to quit drinking and never expressed any interest in trying to quit.<br>\n<u>Now, however, this person does not drink any alcohol<\/u>.<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"al-pos-int","QuestionID":"QID1459","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Alcoholic quitting alcohol Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1297","SecondaryAttribute":"Are you able to pay close attention to the details provided and carefully answer questions that f...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>\n<div>\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Are you able to pay close attention to the details provided and carefully answer questions that follow?&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"outline1","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Are you able to pay close attention to the details provided and carefully answer questions that f...","Choices":{"4":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Yes<\/span>"},"5":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">No<\/span>"},"7":{"Display":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Not sure, probably not<\/span>"}},"ChoiceOrder":["4","5","7"],"Randomization":{"Advanced":null,"TotalRandSubset":"","Type":"All"},"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[{"ChoiceID":"4","Grades":{"SC_d5twgEAWyuaAM0C":1},"index":0},{"ChoiceID":"5","Grades":{"SC_d5twgEAWyuaAM0C":"2"},"index":1},{"ChoiceID":"7","Grades":{"SC_d5twgEAWyuaAM0C":"3"},"index":2}],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":8,"NextAnswerId":4,"QuestionID":"QID1297","RecodeValues":{"4":"1","5":"0","7":"99"}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1273","SecondaryAttribute":"Before we begin the survey, we would just like to verify with you some questions to make sure tha...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Before we begin the survey, we would just like to verify with you some questions to make sure that you qualify to participate in this study.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q55","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Before we begin the survey, we would just like to verify with you some questions to make sure tha...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID1273","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Before we begin the survey, we would just like to verify with you some questions to make sure that you qualify to participate in this study."}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1316","SecondaryAttribute":"Caring Parent Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Caring Parent<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">This person used to be a &ldquo;deadbeat&rdquo; parent. In the past, this person never showed any real affection for their children and never expressed any interest in their children&rsquo;s lives.<br \/>\n<u>Now, however, this person is a very caring and involved parent<\/u>.<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"par-pos-int","QuestionID":"QID1316","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Caring Parent Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":4}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1307","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write Label 2","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write Label 2","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q37","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGr