cupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person used to be a very caring and involved father. In the past, this person never showed real affection for his children and always expressed interest in his children&#39;s lives. Now, however, this person is not a very caring father and is not involved in his children&#39;s lives.","DataExportTag":"Q1540","QuestionID":"QID1540"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1617","SecondaryAttribute":"In this part of the study are 12 different vignettes describing changes in people on various soci...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>In this part of the study are 12 different vignettes describing changes in people on <strong><u>various social and personal behaviors<\/u><\/strong> (12 pages).<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>You&#39;ll be asked to indicate whether you think this change is morally good or bad and whether it reflects the person&#39;s true self or surface self.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"study1intro","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In this part of the study are 12 different vignettes describing changes in people on various soci...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1617","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1618","SecondaryAttribute":"In this part of the study are 8 different vignettes describing changes in people on various polit...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>In this part of the study are 8 different vignettes describing changes in people <strong><u>on various political issues<\/u><\/strong> (8 pages).<\/div>\n\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>You'll be asked to indicate whether you think this change is more al