 own personal preferences:<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Mac-PC","QuestionID":"QID1450","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","TextPosition":"inline","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Mac or PC, do you have a preference? \u00a0 Please indicate your own personal preferences:","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Strongly prefer Mac"},"2":{"Display":"Prefer Mac"},"4":{"Display":"No preference"},"5":{"Display":"Prefer PC"},"6":{"Display":"Strongly prefer PC"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","4","5","6"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[{"ChoiceID":"1","Grades":{"SC_d5twgEAWyuaAM0C":1},"index":0},{"ChoiceID":"2","Grades":{"SC_d5twgEAWyuaAM0C":"2"},"index":1},{"ChoiceID":"4","Grades":{"SC_d5twgEAWyuaAM0C":"3"},"index":2},{"ChoiceID":"5","Grades":{"SC_d5twgEAWyuaAM0C":"4"},"index":3},{"ChoiceID":"6","Grades":{"SC_d5twgEAWyuaAM0C":"5"},"index":4}],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":6,"SubSelector":"TX","RecodeValues":{"2":"2","4":"3","5":"4","6":"5"},"VariableNaming":{"1":"Strongly prefer Mac","2":"Prefer Mac","4":"No preference","5":"Prefer PC","6":"Strongly prefer PC"},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Please indicate your own personal preferences:"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1362","SecondaryAttribute":"Mistreating employees Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this perso...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Mistreating employees<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">This person used to treat employees well. In the past, this person never yelled at them or did anything to embarrass them publicly.<br \/>\n<u>Now, however, this person often yells at them and publicly embarrasses them for minor infractions<\/u>.<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"boss-neg-int","QuestionID":"QID1362","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Mistreating employees Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this perso...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":4}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1534","SecondaryAttribute":"Mistreating employees Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this perso...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Mistreating employees<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person used to treat employees well. In the past, this person never yelled at them or did anything to publicly embarrass them. Now, however, this person often yells at them and publicly embarrasses them for minor infractions.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Mistreating employees Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this perso...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":4,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Mistreating employees<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person used to treat employees well. In the past, this person never yelled at them or did anything to publicly embarrass them. Now, however, this person often yells at them and publicly embarrasses them for minor infractions.","DataExportTag":"Q1534","QuestionID":"QID1534"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1370","SecondaryAttribute":"Not respecting ethnic minorities \u00a0 Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Not respecting ethnic minorities<\/strong><\/u><\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.\n<div><br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">This person lives in a culture that treats all ethnic groups equally. In the past, this person also treated ethnic minorities with respect and believed that minorities should have equal rights.<br \/>\n<u>Now, however, this person mistreats ethnic minorities and does not think that minorities should have equal rights<\/u>.<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"EM-neg-int","QuestionID":"QID1370","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Not respecting ethnic minorities \u00a0 Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":4}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1546","SecondaryAttribute":"Not respecting ethnic minorities \u00a0 Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{