ost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">In the past, this person used to believe that football was the best sport and only followed football.<br \/>\n<u>Now, however, this person only watches baseball and he thinks that baseball is the best sport<\/u>.&nbsp;<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Prefer baseball Imagine someone is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a di...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Prefer dogs<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nIn the past, this person used to only have cats as pets. Now, however, this person strongly prefers dogs and only has them as pets.","DataExportTag":"N-baseball-int","QuestionID":"QID1588"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1350","SecondaryAttribute":"Prefer cats Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a di...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Prefer cats<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">In the past, this person used to only have dogs as pets.<br \/>\n<u>Now, however, this person strongly prefers cats and only has them as pets<\/u>.&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"N-cat-int","QuestionID":"QID1350","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Prefer cats Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a di...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1516","SecondaryAttribute":"Prefer cats Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a di...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Prefer cats<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nIn the past, this person used to only have dogs as pets. Now, however, this person strongly prefers cats and only has them as pets.&nbsp;&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Prefer cats Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a di...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Prefer cats<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nIn the past, this person used to only have dogs as pets. Now, however, this person strongly prefers cats and only has them as pets.&nbsp;&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Q1516","QuestionID":"QID1516"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1522","SecondaryAttribute":"Prefer cats Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a di...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Prefer cats<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nIn the past, this person used to only have dogs as pets. Now, however, this person strongly prefers cats and only has them as pets.&nbsp;&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Prefer cats Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a di...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Prefer cats<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nIn the past, this person used to only have dogs as pets. Now, however, this person strongly prefers cats and only has them as pets.&nbsp;&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Q1522","QuestionID":"QID1522"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1398","SecondaryAttribute":"Prefer dogs Imagine someone is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a differ...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Prefer dogs<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">In the past, this person used to only have cats as pets.<br \/>\n<u>Now, however, this person strongly prefers dogs and only has them as pets<\/u>.<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"N-dog-int","QuestionID":"QID1398","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Prefer dogs Imagine someone is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a differ...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1320","SecondaryAttribute":"Respect ethnic minorities Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this p...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Respect ethnic minorities<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">This person lives in a culture that oppresses ethnic minorities. In the past, this person also mistreated ethnic minorities and never expressed any interest in giving minorities equal rights.<br \/>\n<u>Now, however, this person treats ethnic minorities with respect and believes that minorities should have equal rights<\/u>.<\/span><br \/>\n&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"EM-pos-int","QuestionID":"QID1320","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Respect ethnic minorities Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this p...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1474","SecondaryAttribute":"Respect ethnic minorities Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this p...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Respect ethnic minorities<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person lives in a culture that oppresses ethnic minorities. In the past, this person also mistreated ethnic minorities and never expressed any interest in giving minorities equal rights. Now, however, this person treats ethnic minorities with respect and believes that minorities should have equal rights.<br \/>\n&nbsp;","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Respect ethnic minorities Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this p...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Respect ethnic minorities<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person lives in a culture that oppresses ethnic minorities. In the past, this person also mistreated ethnic minorities and never expressed any interest in giving minorities equal rights. Now, however, this person treats ethnic minorities with respect and believes that minorities should have equal rights.<br \/>\n&nbsp;","DataExportTag":"Q1474","QuestionID":"QID1474"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1602","SecondaryAttribute":"Sexual behavior \u00a0 Someone\u00a0used to be sexually promiscuous and had sex with multiple partners. How.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Sexual behavior <\/strong><\/u><\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Someone&nbsp;used to be sexually promiscuous and had sex with multiple partners. However, now this person is monogamous and has stopped being promiscuous.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Sexual behavior \u00a0 Someone\u00a0used to be sexually promiscuous and had sex with multiple partners. How...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Theism&nbsp;<\/strong><\/u><\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Someone used to be an atheist and did not believe in God. However, now this person is&nbsp;very religious and openly expresses one's belief in God.<\/div>","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"DataExportTag":"mon-int","QuestionID":"QID1602"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1595","SecondaryAttribute":"Somebody used to be homosexual. However, now he is married to a woman and no longer has sex with...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Somebody used to be homosexual. However, now he is married to a woman and no longer has sex with men.","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q325","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HBAR","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":100,"GridLines":10,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Somebody used to be homosexual. However, now he is married to a woma