ritized his financial success above all else. However, now somebody works in a job where he helps others but does not make a lot of money.<br><br>How much do you agree with the following statement?<br><br>\u201cAt his very essence, there was always something deep within somebody calling him to stop rioritizingng his financial success above all else, and then this true self emerged.\u201d","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"money","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","CSSliderMin":0,"CSSliderMax":9,"GridLines":10,"SnapToGrid":false,"NumDecimals":"0","ShowValue":true,"CustomStart":false,"NotApplicable":false,"CenterLabels":true,"MobileFirst":true},"QuestionDescription":"Somebody used to make a lot of money and prioritized his financial success above all else. Howeve...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"True self-rating 2"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":3,"Labels":{"1":{"Display":"Strongly Disagree"},"2":{"Display":"Strongly Agree"}},"QuestionID":"QID1441"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1440","SecondaryAttribute":"Somebody used to not pay attention to gender issues in the workplace. However, now, somebody work...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Somebody used to not pay attention to gender issues in the workplace. However, now, somebody works hard to think about gender issues and support women in the workplace. <br><br>How much do you agree with the following statement?<br><br>&nbsp;\u201cAt his very essence, there was always something deep within somebody calling him to support women in the workplace, and then this true self emerged.\u201d","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"genderissue","QuestionType":"Slider","Selector":"HSLIDER","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":fa