 is a police officer and works in a station that support corruption. In the past, this person has also participated in police corruption. Now, however, this person does not engage in corrupt activities and always conducts oneself in an ethical manner.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Stop engaging in corruption Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Stop engaging in corruption<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person is a police officer and works in a station that support corruption. In the past, this person has also participated in police corruption. Now, however, this person does not engage in corrupt activities and always conducts oneself in an ethical manner.","DataExportTag":"N-PC-","QuestionID":"QID1570"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1611","SecondaryAttribute":"Stop prioritizing financial success\u00a0 \u00a0 Someone used to make a lot of money and prioritized one's..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Stop prioritizing financial success&nbsp;<\/strong><\/u><\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Someone used to make a lot of money and prioritized one's financial success above all else. However, now this person works in a job where this person helps others but does not make a lot of money.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Stop prioritizing financial success\u00a0 \u00a0 Someone used to make a lot of money and prioritized one's...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Gender equality&nbsp;<\/strong><\/u><\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Someone&nbsp;used to not pay attention to gender issues in the workplace. However, now, this person works hard to think about gender issues and support women in the workplace.<\/div>","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"DataExportTag":"fin-int","QuestionID":"QID1611"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1299","SecondaryAttribute":"Study Outline\u00a0This survey involves scenarios\u00a0related to evaluating others and behavioural\u00a0changes","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<strong><u><span style=\"font-size:24px;\">Study Outline<\/span><\/u><\/strong>&nbsp;<br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">This survey involves scenarios&nbsp;related to evaluating others and behavioural&nbsp;changes.<\/span><br>\n<br><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">\nStructure:<\/span>\n<ul>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">12 vignettes in 12 pages.<\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">8 vignettes in 8 pages.<\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">2 scales in 2 pages.<\/span><\/li>\n\t<li><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Brief feedback and demographics questions in 2 pages.&nbsp;<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Overall: 24 brief pages.<\/span><br>\n<br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">For opinion related questions - There are no \u201cright\u201d or \u201cwrong\u201d opinion answers, so please state your opinion as honestly as possible.&nbsp;<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"outline-int","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Study Outline\u00a0This survey involves scenarios\u00a0related to evaluating others and behavioural\u00a0changes...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1299","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1325","SecondaryAttribute":"Support terrorism\u00a0 Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person h..","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Support terrorism&nbsp;<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">This person lives in a culture that does not support terrorism. In the past, this person did not support the idea of terrorism.<br \/>\n<u>Now, however, this person believes that terrorism is an acceptable way to achieve political goals<\/u>.<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"ter-neg-int","QuestionID":"QID1325","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Support terrorism\u00a0 Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person h...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1480","SecondaryAttribute":"Terrorism is wrong Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person h...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Terrorism is wrong<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person lives in a culture that does not support terrorism. In the past, this person did not support the idea of terrorism. However, now this person believes that terrorism is an acceptable way to achieve political goals.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Terrorism is wrong Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person h...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Terrorism is wrong<\/strong><\/u><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person lives in a culture that does not support terrorism. In the past, this person did not support the idea of terrorism. However, now this person believes that terrorism is an acceptable way to achieve political goals.","DataExportTag":"Q1480","QuestionID":"QID1480"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1552","SecondaryAttribute":"Terrorism is wrong Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person h...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong><u>Terrorism is wrong<\/u><\/strong><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person lives in a culture that supports terrorism. In the past, this person supported the idea of terrorism to achieve political goals. Now, however, this person believes that terrorism is wrong.","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Terrorism is wrong Imagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person h...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":4,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><strong><u>Terrorism is wrong<\/u><\/strong><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\nImagine someone who is different from you in almost every way -- this person has a different occupation and prefers different things than you.<br \/>\n<br \/>\nThis person lives in a culture that supports terrorism. In the past, this person supported the idea of terrorism to achieve political goals. Now, however, this person believes that terrorism is wrong.","DataExportTag":"Q1552","QuestionID":"QID1552"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1295","SecondaryAttribute":"Thank you, you completed the survey. A few quick final questions (4 on this page) and demographic...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Thank you, you completed the survey.<div><br>A few quick final questions (4 on this page) and demographics (6 questions in the next page)...<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"funnel-int","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Thank you, you completed the survey. A few quick final questions (4 on this page) and demographic...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID1295","QuestionText_Unsafe":"Thank you, you completed the survey.<div><br>A few quick final questions (this page) and demographics (next page)...<\/div>","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1599","SecondaryAttribute":"Theism\u00a0 \u00a0 Someone used to be an atheist and did not believe in God. However, now this person is\u00a0v","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Theism&nbsp;<\/strong><\/u><\/span><div>&nbsp;<\/div><div>Someone used to be an atheist and did not believe in God. However, now this person is&nbsp;very religious and openly expresses one-self's belief in God.<\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Theism\u00a0 \u00a0 Someone used to be an atheist and did not believe in God. However, now this person is\u00a0v...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<span style=\"font-size:22px;\"><u><strong>Homosexual&nbsp;<\/strong><\/u><\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div>Someone used to be unpatriotic and deeply critical of one's country. However, now this person is very patriotic and openly expresses love for one's country.<\/div>","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"DataExportTag":"the-int","QuestionID":"QID1599"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1285","SecondaryAttribute":"This is the last question.... Please rate your satisfaction with the pay\/compensation offered for...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>This is the last question....<\/div><div><br><\/div>Please rate your satisfaction with the pay\/compensation offered for this task (note - this will not impact your pay in any way)","DataExportTag":"funnel-pay","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"This is the last question.... Please rate your satisfaction with the pay\/compensation offered for...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"0<br>Extremely unsatisfied"},"2":{"Display":"1"},"3":{"Display":"2"},"4":{"Display":"3<br>Neutral"},"5":{"Display":"4"},"6":{"Display":"5"},"7":{"Display":"6<br>Very satisfied"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5","6","7"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"QuestionID":"QID1285","RecodeValues":{"1":"0","2":"1","3":"2","4":"3","5":"4","6":"5","7":"6"},"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Please rate your satisfaction with the pay\/compensation offered for this MTurk HIT (note - this will not impact your pay in any way)","NextChoiceId":8,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_brLyDVuvvTEvGiG","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1619","SecondaryAttribute":"This is the third part of the study. It includes brief questions about your generalized views (2...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<div>This is the third part of the study.<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>It includes brief questions about your generalized views (2 pages).<br>After that there are only quick demographics and wrap-up questions.<br><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"This is the third part of the study. It includes brief questions about your generalized views (2...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<div>In this part of the study are 12 different vignettes describing changes in people (12 pages).<\/div><div><br><\/div><div>You'll be asked to indicate whether you think this change is morally good or bad and whether it reflects the person's true self or surface self.<br><\/div>","DataExportTag":"lastpart-intr